  "title": "Fruit Icebox Pie",
  "description": "This is a wonderful make-ahead pie that 's made of a chocolate cookie crumb crust spread with a sweet buttery layer, and a whipped cream filling studded with chopped dates, nuts, crushed pineapple and sliced bananas. Chocolate crumbs add a perfect finishing touch. Chill this heavenly pie overnight.",
